    "_jsearchQuotaComment": "RapidAPI bills for every request past the monthly quota, so jsearchQueriesPerRun is a ceiling, not a promise: each run takes an even share of what the quota has left across the runs the period still has room for, and never touches the reserve. monthlyLimit and periodDays are only fallbacks for the first run — after that the real figures come from RapidAPI's response headers. Raise reserve if a run is ever billed anyway; lower it to trade cushion for coverage.",
